Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment. "}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le06ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le06ob08re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "image": "engenn3le06ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: This is our conference room. Everyone, this is Peter Smith, our new intern.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hello.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Peter, we need to complete the items on the training\nworkshop list. Let's get started.<br/>", "image": "engenn3le06ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "50", "id": 1}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Let me grab my pen and notebook. Here they are.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: You already have all of the company's login details and passwords. Look after them. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, sir.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: The work day starts at 9:00 a.m. and finishes at 5:00. You have one hour for lunch.<br/>", "image": "engenn3le06ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "13500", "id": 2}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Do we work after 5:00 p.m. sometimes?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Maybe a couple times a month. The mail arrives at 9:15 a.m. every morning and needs to be sorted. Sarah can help you get started with that. Paul will be your supervisor. He is swamped with work. I know you are going to be busy ...<br/>", "image": "engenn3le06ob08re2img01.jpg", "time": "30750", "id": 3}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Paul</span>: Yes ... You will be ... I like my coffee with milk and sugar, thanks!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Where is my office?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Interns don't have offices. You share a cubicle with Amanda.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Right ...", "image": "engenn3le06ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "51500", "id": 4}]}}]}, {"title": "", "id": 2, "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn3le06ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What is notetaking?</span>", "image": "", "time": "12000", "id": 1}, {"text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What are notes?</span>", "image": "", "time": "37000", "id": 2}, {"text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What do you include in your notes?</span>", "image": "", "time": "56300", "id": 3}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter Gets a Part-Time Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Training Workshop"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately explain information about  interests, hobbies, and preferences in   communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to  visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary   and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative  topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic   vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible   pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to  visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary   and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places  to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of   vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places  to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of   vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places  to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of   vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the  communicative topics for this level through the use of   appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures,   and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the  communicative topics for this level through the use of   appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures,   and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Note-Taking"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Note-taking is an important skill."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you take notes, you write down words, dates and  numbers that are the most important parts of a conversation or piece of writing. </br> </br> Notes do  not  have all the information, they have  <span class=\"italic\">the most  important information.</span> </br></br>Notes include:</br><br>1. <span class=\"strong\">A title and date</span> </br>2. <span class=\"strong\">What's new to you?</span> Do not write down facts you  already know.<br/>3. <span class=\"strong\">What's relevant?</span> What information are you going to  use later?</br>4. <span class=\"strong\">Dates of events</span></br>5. <span class=\"strong\">Names of people</span></br></br>Often, you use bullet points and arrows to organize the  information. Arrows show how things are connected. This can be done, for example, when you use the <span class=\"strong\">simple present tense </span>in affirmative form.</br>This can also be done, for example, when using <span class=\"strong\">verbs with infinitives</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The work day starts at 8:00 a.m. and finishes at 4:00."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I need to write this down."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "conference room"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a room where employees sit together to have meetings"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our conference room has a lot of windows."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in an office environment."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "workshop"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a training session"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter has to complete the workshop for new  employees."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to enroll"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be a part of a class or activity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am enrolled in a Business course."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "supervisor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who looks over someone else's work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  The supervisor was busy in his office."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I am swamped"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "overloaded; too much"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He is swamped with work today."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to ensure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to check that you do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please ensure that you read the form."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "receptionist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who works in an office and  answers phone calls and emails for others"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The receptionist gave me the password."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "overtime"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "work that is done outside regular hours"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to do a lot of overtime this month."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob08aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le06ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of a topic that you like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find a paragraph about the topic online, in a newspaper or magazine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make notes on the information in the paragraph."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify a topic I am interested in."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I include names and dates."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify important information about a topic."}]}]}